{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46 2期生の丹生明里(にぶあかり)です🐸🥕"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5N8PKBRBGQ585PQZ79H0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、美穂と一緒に豆柴カフェに行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていうか、もう、癒されまくりで…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっといられるくらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5P9S39VH7TGBVJG25ND7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ほぼ写ってない😅\nでも、ワンコが可愛ければいいの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のうちでは柴犬を2匹飼っています！\nこの間もブログで一匹載せたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからもうワンコには目がなくて…🤦‍♀️\nおチビちゃんもいて可愛かった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美穂がね、一度もワンコと触れ合ったことなかったらしくて、でもだんだん触れ合ってて良かったなぁ〜って思った！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5QCT3J8BGSNWVN7CFS4W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n#彼女がワンコと触れ合ってるなう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、その後にカラオケに行きました🎤\nすっごく久しぶりだったし、何よりメンバーと一緒に行ったのがお初でした！！！楽しかった💫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美穂の歌声超可愛いの！！\nもうなんと言えばいいんだろう、透き通る感じ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニットも一緒でね、美穂のソロパートでも可愛いなぁって思っていたけど、側で生で歌声を聴いたんだけど、可愛過ぎた！なのに盛り上がる系の曲だとすっごく面白い！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5RG0FHHB8K3NSKZ65WVW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるワンコと美穂と私でスリーショット📸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいて楽しかった〜！またどこか行きたいな☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、家でタピオカを茹でたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きんちゃん(金村美玖)がタピオカ大好きでしょっちゅう飲んでて、しかもこの間家で茹でたって言ってたのが羨ましくて、以前乾燥タピオカを購入していたのです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをやっとこさ茹でました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に美味しかった！ただ茹でるだけだから、簡単だし😁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまっているアイスカフェラテに入れて飲んだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で好きな量に調節できるからいいね👍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日16日はアルバムの個別握手会だ〜🤝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会なので楽しみです！\nワクワク！\n何着るかはお楽しみに〜✌️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5SKRAWE844BH1V9A3N8G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うひょ〜い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1X5TP1KJDBKZGHPXACRB6B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なおねこパシャり📸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでいただきありがとうごさいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#41"}],"source":"archive"}